 "_method": "Peak-frame union: every 3rd frame over f0..f70 rendered over a flat #808080 plate, bbox of pixels differing by >10 on any channel, unioned across frames. Registered defaults plus real content in every slot \u2014 a box measured on EMPTY slots is the box of a component drawing nothing, because empty slots are filtered before the component sees them.",
 "_six_not_measured": "CaptionMatch, EmojiCard, LowerThird, PlainText, QuoteCard and TornPaper are FRAME COMPOSITIONS, not motion graphics \u2014 they have no directory under src/remotion/src/motion-graphics, so MGCraftProbe cannot render them and this harness reports NOT MEASURED rather than a box. The first run called them 'NOTHING DREW', which is the same words a genuinely blank component produces: nine of twelve reported it at once, and nine zeros together are a harness fault, not nine findings. They need the frame-composition probe (render-frame-comp-proof.mjs), which is the next step.",
 "_compared_against": "The registered boxes B1 posted: CaptionMatch 604x286, EmojiCard 626x450, PlainText 548x295, QuoteCard 837x663, Stamp 1080x760, TornPaper 1080x435, Reticle 822x919, StatCard 1012x301. PillCluster, RankedList and StickyNotes have no registered box on record, so they are measurements without a comparison, not passes."
}